# Compositions of interactions.
cuboid 3x3x3

case 3.1 Orbit to look from below, then drag a D sticker
note Turns follow the grabbed sticker in any view: D right column towards the front = R
wait 0.3
drag 60,420 60,300 0.8
wait 0.2
drag D@2,-2,-2 D@2,-2,2 0.5
settle
expect state R

case 3.2 Orbit to look from the back-left, then drag B
note Dragging the B face's top row (left on screen) is B-face U: top layer clockwise
reset
home
drag 630,470 316,470 1.0
wait 0.2
drag B@-2,2,-2 B@2,2,-2 0.5
settle
expect state U

case 3.3 Orbit back to the front
note Dragging right by the same distance orbits back to the starting view
reset
drag 316,470 630,470 1.0
wait 0.3
expect solved
expect camera-moved
expect no-feedback turn

case 3.4 Two drags then two undos
note R, U by drag; undo, undo plays them backwards to solved
reset
wait 0.3
drag F@2,-2,2 F@2,2,2 0.4
settle
drag F@2,2,2 F@-2,2,2 0.4
settle
expect state R U
undo
settle
undo
settle
expect solved
expect feedback undo U

case 3.5 Notation then a drag while it plays
note "R U" queued, a drag adds F behind them: R U F
reset
wait 0.3
moves R U
drag U@-2,2,2 U@2,2,2 0.3
settle
expect state R U F

case 3.6 Orbit while a turn animates
note The turn finishes normally while the view moves
reset
moves R2 U2
drag 60,420 200,420 0.8
settle
expect camera-moved
expect state R2 U2

case 3.7 Scramble then solve
note Two-phase solution plays back to solved
reset
scramble 20 7
wait 0.5
expect unsolved
solve
settle
expect feedback solution
expect solved

case 3.8 Undo after the solve
note Undo takes back the last solver move
undo
settle
expect unsolved
expect feedback undo
